{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から\n日テレハロウィンライブの\nリハーサルをしてたよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の土曜日に\n代々木第一体育館で\n日テレハロウィンライブがあるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンのイベントに出るのは\n初めてなのでドキドキ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/27/3335827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/27/3335827/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギョロ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/27/3335827/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よりめめめめめめ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/27/3335827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は天気が良くてポカポカ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るい時間に外に入れたのは\n朝の10時までだったから\nあんまりポカポカ味わえなかったけど\nやっぱり天気がいいのがいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"霧も雨も曇天もいいな～\nって思うこともあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はやっぱり晴れが1番すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/27/3335827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節によって\nきく音楽って変わるのかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは変わりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期におすすめの音楽\nおしえてください(｡ρω-｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/27/3335827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの他に\n日記を毎日書いてるんだけど\n始めてからちょうど1ヶ月くらいで\nペラペラ～ってめくってみてたら\n大抵、最後に\n「がんばろう～」って書いてある(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばれてないから\nがんばろう～って書いちゃうんだろうなって\n思った(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、がんばる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら、またかいた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばる！\nがんばる！\nがんばる～～～～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/27/3335827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした！"}],"source":"archive"}